# The Debian system copy of setuptools in the pinned python:3.11-slim base is
# 70.3.0. The image upgrades the /usr/local copy used by pip, but the distro
# copy remains and Trivy reports CVE-2025-47273 against it. Track the base-image
# update (Dependabot docker ecosystem) and remove this exception once the
# distro package is >= 78.1.1.
CVE-2025-47273
